Connector Zone Credits Room~
This is a connector zone called Thousand-Mile Road.  It should be used to link up new
up new areas coming in with locations orientated to Fairhaven instead of Sam.
Links to fairhaven at 30573 and xxxxxxxxxxxxx at nnnnn
;                            Oberon
