#17501
Thousand Mile Road~
You see before you an ancient road stretching out south as far as the eye can
see.  It's surface is crushed gravel that has been melded into the dirt from
centuries of footsteps, human, elven, gnome, orc, ogre, dwarf, and even
draconian.  It is said by some that the Gods made the road to bridge the lands
of good, evil, and neutrality Others say it was a military road built by the
minotaurs in an ancient war against Samserra and its allies.  Whatever it's
origins it is said to stretch from one side of the world to the other.    
~
