#17503
Thousand Mile Road~
You are on a wide graveled road stretching far to the south.  The road is
deserted for the most part which is odd.  One would think such a vast road
would be heavily traveled.  To either side are grassy banks and a
pleasant-looking woods, cheery and well-lit.  Small creatures dash thru the
underbrush and birds sing, unafraid, in the branches.    
