#17504
Thousand Mile Road~
The great road continues on for as far as the eye can see.  Minotaur-built, the
military road carves a straight path thru the forest.  Although the war the
road was made for was fought hundreds of years ago, the road is still in
remarkable shape.  Your attention is drawn to the short grass on the
embankments and you realize that someone is still maintaining this highway.  
This fact does not gladden you.    
