#17529
The Edge~
The once magnificent road halts abruptly here as a vast crater yawns before
you.  Stretching nearly a hundred yards in circumference it's surface is a
shiny black glass-like substance.  You peer down into its depths nearly one
hundred feet down and wonder how you are going to get around this obstacle.  
It almost seems like this crater was the result of some violent blast of heat
and destruction.  What sort of power could cause......  Uh oh....  Could it
be?......  Dragon-fire?    
~
