#17573
The End Of The Road~
The vast road that you have traveled for so many miles comes to an abrupt end
here.  To either side the salt marshes are broken by dunes and to the east a
small path cuts thru the last of the marsh grass and runs over the top of a
dune that rises some 15-20 feet.    
