#17598
Thousand Mile Road~
The road slices along a hillside carving its way right thru.  To one side the
hill is cleft from the top straight down a sheer rock face to the edge of the
road.  To the other side the road cut angles downwards fairly steeply.  Along
the sheer rock face a notch is cut about fifteen feet wide inwards.  Within the
notch is a sheer staircase cut right into the bare rock, angling upwards.    
~
